{"id":"7879e03f14f20eeb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/621_相关条件逻辑.md","title":"621 相关条件逻辑","display":"621_相关条件逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{rcond}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{rcond}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow_R B=\\operatorname{rcond}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow_R B=\\operatorname{rcond}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{rcond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{rcond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow_R B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow_R B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与相关性\">3. 自由变元与相关性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{621}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A\\Rightarrow_R B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A\\Rightarrow_R B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义相关性谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cap\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cap\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变元集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{621}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{621}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{621}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{621}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{621}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{621}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow_R B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow_R\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow_R B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow_R\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{621}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{621}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{621}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{621}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{621}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{621}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,621}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,621}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{621}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{621}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{621}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{621}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{621}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{621}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相关条件分配：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RK}^{621}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_R(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B),\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RK}^{621}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_R(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B),\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相关一致性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RD}^{621}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to\\neg(A\\Rightarrow_R\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RD}^{621}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to\\neg(A\\Rightarrow_R\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{621}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RK}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RD}^{621}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{621}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RK}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RD}^{621}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{621}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{621}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相关条件后件规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RRW}^{621}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B),\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RRW}^{621}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B),\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{621}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RRW}^{621}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{621}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{621}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RRW}^{621}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集。每行至少满足下列 4 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{621}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{621}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的非空有限序列的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{621}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{621}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在证明行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A_i)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A_i)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{621}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{621}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{621}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{621}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{621}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{621}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{621}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{621}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{621}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{621}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{621}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{621}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{621}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{621}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{621}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{621}B\\to C\\quad\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\quad\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)}\n{\\vdash_{621}(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)}\\;(RRW).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{621}B\\to C\\quad\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\quad\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,C)}\n{\\vdash_{621}(A\\Rightarrow_R B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_R C)}\\;(RRW).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-相关条件语义\">9. 相关条件语义</h1>\n<p>相关条件模型为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{RMod}_{621},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{RMod}_{621},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并要求</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall X\\subseteq W\\quad \\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall X\\subseteq W\\quad \\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该非空性约束阻止同一相关前件下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B\">\\(\\neg B\\)</span> 同时由空选择集真空成立，对应\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RD}^{621}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{RD}^{621}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{RMod}_{621}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{RMod}_{621}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\Rightarrow_R B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\Rightarrow_R B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(A,B)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{621}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{621}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in⟦ A⟧_{621}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{621}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{RMod}_{621}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{621}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{621}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{621}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{RMod}_{621}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{621}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{621}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的目标差异是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}\\)</span>：条件分配、公理实例、RRW 规则和第 9 节的条件语义均要求前件与相关后件共享命题支撑。普通 CK 条件逻辑没有这一侧条件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RCond}_{621}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{FV}_{621},\\operatorname{BV}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{621},\\operatorname{Sub}_{621},\\equiv_{\\alpha,621},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{621},\\mathsf{Rule}_{621},\\mathsf{Proof}_{621},\\operatorname{last}_{621},\n\\vdash_{621},\\mathsf{Thm}_{621},\\mathsf{Cert}_{621},\n\\mathsf{RMod}_{621},⟦-⟧_{621},\\Vdash_{621},\\models_{621}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{RCond}_{621}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\operatorname{FV}_{621},\\operatorname{BV}_{621},\\operatorname{Rel}_{621},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{621},\\operatorname{Sub}_{621},\\equiv_{\\alpha,621},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{621},\\mathsf{Rule}_{621},\\mathsf{Proof}_{621},\\operatorname{last}_{621},\n\\vdash_{621},\\mathsf{Thm}_{621},\\mathsf{Cert}_{621},\n\\mathsf{RMod}_{621},⟦-⟧_{621},\\Vdash_{621},\\models_{621}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由相关条件公式、支撑相关性、公理、规则、证明关系以及选择函数语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言可靠性、完备性、相关性表示定理或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与相关性","text":"3. 自由变元与相关性","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-相关条件语义","text":"9. 相关条件语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{rcond}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow_R B=\\operatorname{rcond}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{rcond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow_R B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{621}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A\\Rightarrow_R B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{621}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}_{621}(